      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iron_City%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Iron City lies in Shoal Creek Valley north of the Tennessee‑Alabama line, tucked between hills and the creek.",
